  "notes": "Fix manual cartridge illumination blocked by pending presence detection; retain indicator presence gating. Retry a transient IR diagnostic failure once within the unchanged deadline. Reject incompatible legacy PWM cartridge calibration for DC current comparisons. Unplugged charger diagnostics request external supply rather than flagging inactive voltage data. Add read-only heater ADC diagnostics; temperature conversion and safety gating unchanged. Existing temporary Smoke diagnostic bypass remains unchanged.",
